  "b4_text_layer_sanitized": "43\nA horizontal bridge is built across a river. A student standing on the bridge throws a small ball vertically\nupwards with a velocity 4 m s⁻¹. The ball strikes the water surface after 4 s. The height of bridge\nabove water surface is (Take g = 10 m s⁻²) :\n(1)\n56 m\n(2)\n60 m\n(3)\n64 m\n(4)\n68 m\n\n2\n1\n2\nu = −4 m s−1 t = 4 s\ng =\n10 m s−2\ns = −4 × 4 +\n​ ×\n2\n1\n10 × 4 =\n2\n−16 + 80 = 64 m\n",
